  "post_content": "<p align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0cm; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13px; text-align: justify; widows: 2; orphans: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">La intensa programaci&oacute;n cultural y de actividades que se realizan a lo largo del a&ntilde;o en el Museu del Taulell &#39;Manolo Safont&#39; de Onda &quot;ha permitido que en los primeros seis meses del a&ntilde;o las visitas aumenten un 7% con respecto a las cifras del a&ntilde;o pasado&quot;, seg&uacute;n indica una nota del Departamento de Comunicaci&oacute;n del Ayuntamiento, publicada en la web onda.es.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitesmuseutaulell/visitaclubrotaryprovinciacastellomuseutaulellonda2.jpg\" alt=\"visitaclubrotaryprovinciacastellomuseutaulellonda2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitesmuseutaulell/visitaclubrotaryprovinciacastellomuseutaulellonda3.jpg\" alt=\"visitaclubrotaryprovinciacastellomuseutaulellonda3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitesmuseutaulell/visitaclubrotaryprovinciacastellomuseutaulellonda4.jpg\" alt=\"visitaclubrotaryprovinciacastellomuseutaulellonda4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitesmuseutaulell/visitaclubrotaryprovinciacastellomuseutaulellonda5.jpg\" alt=\"visitaclubrotaryprovinciacastellomuseutaulellonda5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitesmuseutaulell/visitaclubrotaryprovinciacastellomuseutaulellonda6.jpg\" alt=\"visitaclubrotaryprovinciacastellomuseutaulellonda6\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitesmuseutaulell/visitaclubrotaryuprov